{"path":"experimental/concurrency/promise","title":"std::experimental::promise (concurrency TS)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>promise <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/concurrency/promise","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"std::experimental::concurrency_v1::promise is a modified version of std::promise provided by the concurrency TS that works with std::experimental::future.","html":"<p><i>This page is about the modified version of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/promise\">std::promise</a></span> provided by the concurrency TS supporting the <code>std::future</code> improvements made by that TS. For the version of <code>promise</code> with type-erased allocator support provided by the Library Fundamentals TSes, see <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/lib_extensions/promise\"><code>std::experimental::fundamentals_v2::promise</code></a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/future&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> promise<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> promise<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw1\">class</span> promise<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>std::experimental::concurrency_v1::promise</code> is a modified version of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/promise\">std::promise</a></span> provided by the concurrency TS that works with <span class=\"t-lc\">std::experimental::future</span>.\n</p><p>The only change from <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/promise\">std::promise</a></span> is that the <code>get_future()</code> member function returns a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/future\"><span class=\"kw2771\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">future</span></span></a></span></code>.\n</p>","headings":[],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/concurrency","title":"Extensions for concurrency"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::promise (concurrency TS)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations. This page is about the modified version of std::promise provided by the concurrency TS supporting the std::future…"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":97,"codeBlockCount":